{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:932030b0618a2337","name":"Gunslinger Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-932030b0618a2337","title":"Gunslinger Talent Trees","revision":18232,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:49:22Z","sha256":"8762d07b6a1efaca86981fa88eb7fe08daf1b84dfa2998b18852373209f773f5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18232","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gunslinger%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-932030b0618a2337","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunslinger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunslinger","referenceId":"reference:223b23a5360318c7"}," gains an additional Gunslinger Talent. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunslinger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunslinger","referenceId":"reference:223b23a5360318c7"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Gunslinger Talent Trees they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Gunslinger Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Awareness Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Awareness_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:ef6961de49868acc"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You are exceptionally good at noticing things and avoiding perilous situations.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Fortune Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortune_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:5bd9c10b1af0ad71"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"}," like to gamble with destiny, putting everything on the line and trusting fate (or ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},") to bring them fortune, fame, and success.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gunslinger Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunslinger_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:85837d9fe1cb952b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You never travel anywhere without a blaster (or two), and you know how to handle yourself in a gunfight.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Pistoleer Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistoleer_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:823c36dca1e8d4b7"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You are a master of wielding two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," at the same time, and can use both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," simultaneously in unusual ways.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Carbineer Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Carbineer_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:90d39562f81c3058"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["While ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pistols"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pistols","referenceId":"reference:e660061b7b03b794"}," offer great versatility and mobility, their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," is a significant limiting factor. Thus, many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunslingers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunslingers"}," choose to specialize in long arms, especially ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Carbines"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Carbines"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sharpshooter Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sharpshooter_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:d5cc3938f81e6973"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You are an expert at long-range combat, using the inherent advantage of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rifle"}," to win the day.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
